WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:17.162
Bobby walked into the gym just as Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

2
00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:20.904
"Line up!"

3
00:00:21.344 --> 00:00:21.844
she said.

4
00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:24.205
"We're going outside."

5
00:00:25.165 --> 00:00:27.146
She was carrying a bag of baseballs.

6
00:00:28.967 --> 00:00:31.248
"Today is going to be fun!"

7
00:00:31.488 --> 00:00:32.209
Bobby thought.

8
00:00:35.831 --> 00:00:38.113
Bobby saw a batting tee on the blacktop.

9
00:00:39.674 --> 00:00:42.936
"Are we playing T-ball?"

10
00:00:43.296 --> 00:00:43.857
he asked.

11
00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:49.380
"Oh, I'm terrible at T-ball," Izzie groaned.

12
00:00:50.461 --> 00:00:54.644
"We're having a T-ball Home Run Derby," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:00:54.664 --> 00:00:57.045
"All right!"

14
00:00:58.006 --> 00:01:00.368
Bobby and Ethan gave each other high fives.

15
00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.281
"What's a home run derby?"

16
00:01:03.661 --> 00:01:04.482
Nina asked.

17
00:01:04.502 --> 00:01:08.325
"It's the best part of baseball season!"

18
00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:09.305
Bobby said.

19
00:01:09.325 --> 00:01:12.928
"It's when the players have a home run contest."

20
00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:18.131
"You each get three tries to hit the ball," Miss Shelly explained.

21
00:01:18.151 --> 00:01:22.534
"The ball must go past that blue line to be a home run."

22
00:01:23.455 --> 00:01:25.516
She pointed to a line on the blacktop.

23
00:01:26.497 --> 00:01:30.340
"The person who hits the most home runs wins," Bobby added.

24
00:01:32.076 --> 00:01:33.416
"Who wants to go first?"

25
00:01:33.857 --> 00:01:34.857
Miss Shelly asked.

26
00:01:35.517 --> 00:01:40.658
"Bobby?" "Usually the worst person goes first," Bobby said.

27
00:01:40.678 --> 00:01:45.840
"I'll go," Nina offered.

28
00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:48.300
"I'm probably the worst."

29
00:01:49.161 --> 00:01:50.341
Miss Shelly frowned.

30
00:01:50.361 --> 00:01:53.462
"There's no best or worst here, Bobby."

31
00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.383
Miss Shelly set the ball on the tee.

32
00:01:58.403 --> 00:02:00.384
"Whenever you're ready!"

33
00:02:00.784 --> 00:02:01.364
she called.

34
00:02:02.272 --> 00:02:03.973
Nina gripped the bat and swung.

35
00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:05.495
She missed!

36
00:02:06.335 --> 00:02:07.236
She swung again.

37
00:02:08.177 --> 00:02:08.937
Another miss!

38
00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:12.139
On her last try, she missed again.

39
00:02:12.159 --> 00:02:15.522
"Your score is zero!"

40
00:02:15.842 --> 00:02:16.523
Bobby said.

41
00:02:16.543 --> 00:02:20.746
"Bobby, that's not nice," Miss Shelly scolded.

42
00:02:20.766 --> 00:02:24.188
"I'll go next," Jason said.

43
00:02:24.208 --> 00:02:26.490
"I'm not very good either."

44
00:02:27.471 --> 00:02:28.752
He stepped up to the tee.

45
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.102
On his third try, he hit the ball!

46
00:02:34.122 --> 00:02:38.045
"Home run!"

47
00:02:38.505 --> 00:02:40.706
Jason cried, jumping up and down.

48
00:02:40.726 --> 00:02:43.468
"No," Bobby said.

49
00:02:43.488 --> 00:02:46.791
"It bounced before it reached the blue line."

50
00:02:47.691 --> 00:02:51.214
He was about to say, "You got a zero too."

51
00:02:51.974 --> 00:02:54.256
But Miss Shelly was giving him a warning look.

52
00:02:54.276 --> 00:02:57.598
"My turn," Izzie said.

53
00:02:59.139 --> 00:03:00.120
First she hit the tee.

54
00:03:01.916 --> 00:03:02.776
Then she missed.

55
00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:06.998
Finally she hit a home run!

56
00:03:07.018 --> 00:03:10.840
"Yeah, Izzie!"

57
00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.260
Nina cheered.

58
00:03:13.661 --> 00:03:14.641
Ethan was next.

59
00:03:16.482 --> 00:03:18.463
He hit a home run on his first try!

60
00:03:18.483 --> 00:03:20.264
"All right!"

61
00:03:20.684 --> 00:03:21.804
he said, nodding.

62
00:03:22.765 --> 00:03:25.266
On his second try, he hit another home run!

63
00:03:25.286 --> 00:03:30.748
"Yeah!" He narrowed his eyes and got ready for his last try.

64
00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.500
Home run!

65
00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.121
"Woo-hoo! Beat that!"

66
00:03:35.161 --> 00:03:36.041
he said to Bobby.

67
00:03:40.323 --> 00:03:44.264
worry. I will," Bobby said, taking the bat.

68
00:03:45.184 --> 00:03:46.445
He took a deep breath.

69
00:03:47.445 --> 00:03:49.325
He did not want to let Ethan beat him.

70
00:03:50.266 --> 00:03:53.707
The Home Run Derby was his favorite major league baseball event.

71
00:03:54.607 --> 00:03:55.607
He had to win!

72
00:04:00.876 --> 00:04:01.276
Whack! Whack!

73
00:04:01.296 --> 00:04:03.177
Whack! Bobby easily hit three home runs.

74
00:04:03.197 --> 00:04:05.497
"Ha!" he said.

75
00:04:05.517 --> 00:04:07.998
"Now what, Miss Shelly?"

76
00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:10.819
"Now we have a tiebreaker.

77
00:04:11.759 --> 00:04:15.540
You and Ethan each get two more tries," she said.

78
00:04:17.701 --> 00:04:18.761
Ethan went first.

79
00:04:19.561 --> 00:04:21.242
He hit the ball way up in the air.

80
00:04:22.122 --> 00:04:24.963
It landed close to the blue line, but not past it.

81
00:04:25.943 --> 00:04:26.943
Then whack!

82
00:04:27.904 --> 00:04:29.004
He hit the ball again.

83
00:04:30.032 --> 00:04:30.952
A home run!

84
00:04:30.972 --> 00:04:33.873
"Not bad," he said, grinning.

85
00:04:34.633 --> 00:04:36.134
He passed the bat to Bobby.

86
00:04:36.994 --> 00:04:38.774
Bobby gripped the bat and swung.

87
00:04:39.775 --> 00:04:40.455
Home run!

88
00:04:41.495 --> 00:04:42.615
Bobby swung again.

89
00:04:43.296 --> 00:04:44.176
Home run!

90
00:04:44.196 --> 00:04:48.017
"I'm the Home Run Derby champion!"

91
00:04:48.477 --> 00:04:49.137
he cheered.

92
00:04:49.157 --> 00:04:51.798
"You're pretty good," Ethan said.

93
00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:53.618
He stuck out his hand.

94
00:04:54.359 --> 00:04:55.599
The boys shook hands.

95
00:04:55.619 --> 00:04:59.120
"You're not so bad either," Bobby said.
